I guess you need to pass handle here?  In the earlier version, you
passed \\WMI0.WQ00, so it worked with NULL handle.  But now it's no
longer so...

Other than that, it looks OK to me.
  Reviewed-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>

